{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Send Your light</b> — corresponding to \"I walk in darkness\" [Psalms 88:7, \"gloom\"]." "<b>and Your truth</b> — corresponding to \"a man of deceit.\"" "<b>And the word ינחוני</b> — corresponding to \"I walk about.\"" "<b>Your holy mountain</b> — Mount Moriah." "<b>and Your dwelling-places</b> — the courtyards that are destined to be built in the Third Temple."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:30:38.789909412Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}